## 6. Document Editing, Markdown Preview & Data Viewer

- **Interactive DataFrame Table Viewer**: Double-clicking any tabular dataset (`.csv`, `.tsv`, `.arff`, `.parquet`, `.avro`, `.sas7bdat`, `.feather`) in the Project Explorer opens it in an interactive table view with a 100 MB large-file guard and row-limit prompt.
- **Notepad & Rich Markdown Preview**: Double-clicking any code or text file opens it in the built-in **Notepad**:
  - Full syntax highlighting for Markdown (`.md`), Java (`.java`), Python (`.py`), SQL (`.sql`), Scala (`.sc`), Kotlin (`.kt`), Shell (`.sh`), JSON, YAML, and XML.
  - Overlaid **Edit / Preview** toggle buttons in the top-right of Markdown files for live GitHub-Flavored Markdown rendering (tables, strikethrough, autolinks, and theme-aware code blocks).
  - Integrated spell checker with English dictionary, code folding, occurrence marking, and fast Find & Replace (`Ctrl+F` / `Ctrl+H`).

